OL,3,GNEWSAFive deny football pitch hearse
OL,4,Adisorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men have denied a raft of charges
OL,7,Fafter a funeral hearse was driven onto
OL,8,Fa football pitch three years ago.
OL,10,FThe incident, which took place during
OL,11,Fhalf time at the Dunston UTS v
OL,12,FGateshead match at Dunston Football
OL,13,FClub, is believed to have been linked
OL,14,Fto a number of others.
OL,16,FThese included reports of criminal
OL,17,Fdamage across addresses in the Dunston
OL,18,Fand Byker areas, as well as a report of
OL,19,Fa stolen vehicle from the Durham area.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
