OL,3,GNEWSAFive deny football pitch hearse
OL,4,Adisorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAppearing at Newcastle Crown Court, the
OL,7,Ffive - aged between 31 and 53 - have
OL,8,Fpleaded not guilty to all charges
OL,9,Fagainst them and will return to the
OL,10,Fcourt on 1 November.
